{
  "name": "DAVE THE DIVER",
  "steam_appid": 1868140,
  "exe": "GameAssembly.dll",
  "summary": "Your screen's full resolution, 21:9 and 32:9 included, instead of 16:9 with side panels.",
  "toggle": "Remove Black Bars",
  "tested": "3440x1440 (Steam, build of October 2026)",
  "notes": "The game only offers 16:9 resolutions (IsTargetRatio) and defaults to the largest 16:9 size (GetBestResolution). Its view setup (CoUpdateResolution) divides the screen shape by 16:9 and, when wider, narrows the camera and shows side-art panels; making that ratio 1 keeps the full width and hides the panels, as the old BepInEx mod did at runtime.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "description": "resolution list: accept every aspect ratio (IsTargetRatio returns true)",
      "pattern": "66 0F 6E C9 0F 5B C9 66 0F 6E C2 0F 5B C0 F3 0F 5E C8 F3 0F 5C 0D ?? ?? ?? ?? F3 0F 59 0D ?? ?? ?? ?? F3 0F 2C C1 85 C0 0F 94 C0 C3",
      "offset": 0,
      "value": "bytes:B0 01 C3"
    },
    {
      "description": "default resolution: keep the screen's own, not the largest 16:9 (GetBestResolution)",
      "pattern": "F3 0F 5E F0 F3 0F 5C F7 F3 41 0F 59 F0 F3 0F 2C C6 85 C0 0F 84 ?? ?? ?? ??",
      "offset": 19,
      "value": "bytes:90 E9"
    },
    {
      "description": "view setup (CameraResolution.CoUpdateResolution): screen shape ÷ 16:9 becomes 1, so the side-art panels hide and the camera keeps the full width (divss xmm9,[16:9] -> divss xmm9,xmm9)",
      "pattern": "45 0F 5B C9 66 0F 6E C0 0F 5B C0 F3 44 0F 5E C8 F3 44 0F 5E 0D ?? ?? ?? ??",
      "offset": 16,
      "value": "bytes:F3 45 0F 5E C9 0F 1F 40 00"
    },
    {
